  "bodyText": "Home\nVisit Us\nExhibitions\nEvents\nOnline Talks\nOxfordshire’s Military Heritage in 50 Objects\nCollections\nBlog\nResearch\nLearning\nShop\nCart\nMy Account\nAbout\nBecome a Friend\nSupport Us\nRoom Hire\n\n01993 810 210\n\nfrontofhouse@sofo.org.uk\n\n  \nHome\nEvents\nExhibitions\nCollections\nFriends’ Membership\nVisit\nShop\nBasket\nMy Account\nOxfordshire’s Military Heritage in 50 Objects\nResearch\nLearning\nOnline Talks\nBlog\nSupport Us\nRoom Hire\nImage Services\nAbout\nTalks, Tours and Community Activities at the Museum\n\n \n\nOutreach Talks\nOxfordshire's Military Heritage in 50 Objects\n\nThe Oxfordshire Yeomanry D Squadron 'pub' sign.\n\n \n\nBook our new outreach talk, Oxfordshire’s Military Heritage in 50 Objects.\n\nThe museum holds a fascinating collection of over 14,500 objects. Fifty objects across the archive have been selected to provide moments of insight into the county’s military history. These objects reflect on the personal stories of not only those who fought in both The Oxfordshire and Buckinghamshire Light Infantry and Oxfordshire Yeomanry regiments, but also those living in Oxfordshire who have been impacted by conflict.\n\nPrices start from £65, and can be delivered over Zoom or in person at your organisation's venue.\n\nGet a preview of our favourite 50 Objects here!\n\nBook a Museum Tour\n\nLet us know your interests and we will provide the right expert to lead a Museum tour for your group. Prices start from £40 and your members qualify for the group admission rate of £4.50 per person. In addition, you can book tea, coffee and home-made cakes or wine and nibbles.\n\nSEN Groups\n\nThe Museum is fully accessible and we welcome visits from groups with special needs. As above, we can provide tours, handling sessions or talks to suit your needs, starting from £40.\n\nYoung people’s community groups\n\nThe Soldiers of Oxfordshire Museum regularly hosts young people’s groups, from artists to Cadets and Cub Scouts. We provide fun educational group visits and can help facilitate more structured workshops on request. Our evening education admission price starts at £5.50 per child/young person.\n\nHome Schooled Students\n\nWe welcome groups of home schooled students and can provide education sessions tailored to your needs.\n\n \n\nContact us about Talks & Tours:\nYour Name\nYour Email\nMessage\nType\nAre you looking to book a tour at the museum or a talk at your own venue?\nContact Us\n\nSoldiers of Oxfordshire Museum\nPark Street.\nWoodstock\nOxfordshire OX20 1SN\n\nPhone and Email:\nGeneral Enquiries & Event Tickets: 01993 810 211\nfrontofhouse@sofo.org.uk\n\nPrivacy Policy\nTerms and conditions",
